repository-code: "https://github.com/coderback/prop-challenge-pricing"
abstract: >-
  Code, day series, analysis plans and results for the working paper "Fair on Paper: What a Prop-Firm
  Challenge Is Worth, and Who Pays for It". It prices a retail prop firm's published evaluation contract on
  twenty years of intraday index prices at measured broker costs. One command reproduces every table, figure
  and the PDF. Nothing here is investment advice.
